{
    //MAP DIALOGS

    "RSVRI.3Bros": "These are contract papers with food distributors and inventory records. All of them bear Lorenzo's signature.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros1": "They are filled with non-perishable goods and gardening items.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros2": "There is a note down here.#It is a list of things to be done in the future. It must have gotten lost down here.#You put it back, avoiding looking at what is written.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros3": "It is a flower vase that has not been used yet.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros4": "It seems that something down here is missing.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros5": "It smells very good.",
    "RSVRI.3Bros6": "It is growing strong.",

    "RSVRI.AguarBasement": "A stack of books about Ancient Biology.#One book stands out for appearing very worn.#It has a marked page that says:#Caution! The creation of bacterial life requires attention. Keep in mind that it must not be pruned, or it may generate unimaginable effects, no matter how harmless it may seem.#The page continues with other warnings.#Strange...#The book is covered with an unusual substance... it has a familiar farm smell.",
    "RSVRI.AguarBasement1": "The first book in the stack has the title 'Herbivorous Consciousness'.#One page stands out:#No matter how simple it may seem, each plant presents a consciousness and its own personality. Knowing how to choose the right one can be very useful for your magical experiments. For a plant with a bad temperament may bring serious consequences and make it difficult to...#*highlighted*...extraction of consciousness... *highlighted*",

    "RSVRI.AguarLab": "There seems to be some kind of infestation on the ceiling.#It is coming from the center of the house.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab1": "There are splinters torn from the wood, some old and others more recent.#There is a smell of cinnamon mixed with coconut.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab2": "It is full of seeds.#By the box and their strange shape, they must have come from somewhere very far away.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab3": "Although they seem to be the same plant, the leaves of each one have different patterns.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab4": "These are notes detailing something... They were written by Dr.Aguar.#They seem to be extremely important...#It seems to be a revelation...#*reading*... *reading*...#You do not understand absolutely anything that is written, because of the doctor's handwriting.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab5": "It is a strangely familiar plant...#It seems at ease here.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab6": "Note: Initial phase.#- Development of a clay-based fertilizer -",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab7": "These are botanical materials prepared for surgical procedures of analysis and extraction processing.#...#At least that is what the description in the corner says.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab8": "On the plant there are several wires that follow the signals it gives.",
    "RSVRI.AguarLab9": "The plant's signals seem to be fine.",

    "RSVRI.AlissaHouse": "Locked.",
    "RSVRI.AlissaHouse1": "Inside the box there are several travel and family photos, very well preserved.",
    "RSVRI.AlissaHouse2": "There are several bed sheets and rugs, piled up in stacks.",
    "RSVRI.AlissaHouse3": "The wardrobe is dominated by dust.#*cough* *cough* *cough*",

    "RSVRI.BertHouse": "It is the family's landline phone.#Next to it there is a note with several numbers, along with the names of several village children.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse1": "On the package it is written:#'Pie dough'",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse2": "The light that enters through the window fills the room.#This fills you with determination.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse3": "On the jar there is a sticker with the name 'Nina'.#It is truly a beautiful plant, it must have received a lot of love and care.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse4": "There is a sticker here.#It is written 'Little Foot'.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse5": "In the drawer below there are several pencils and colored crayons.#They are spread throughout the drawer.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse6": "There is a paper attached with tape, written 'Slime', on the jar.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse7": "The jar has artistic details that match the plant.#Even the sticker with the name 'Gabe' matches everything.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse8": "It is a miniature garden with several types of plants from the region, harvested and planted recently.#There is a written message:#'Property of T-R-I-N-N-I-E - NO BUTTERFLIES'",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse9": "The painting intrigues you.#It seems to allude to a builder...",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse10": "At the bottom of the fireplace there is a mechanical device.#It must be used to light the fire without needing someone.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse11": "The plant has a sticker with the name 'Edward'. Its flowers are quite beautiful.#Ouch!#It is full of thorns, be careful!",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse12": "The base is full of glitter and chalk.#It has a very colorful sticker, written 'Pasta'.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse13": "The pot is new, it seems the plant was placed very recently.#Next to the pot, there also seems to be a new sticker with the name 'Maat'.",
    "RSVRI.BertHouse14": "It is such a bruised little plant sprout. It is receiving medical care.#On the pot the name 'Igor' is written.#It should recover and grow strong!",

    "RSVRI.BlairHouse": "This fishing trap...#Did it move???...",

    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse": "It is a rather worn neptunite. It must have been used as a sword sharpener.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse1": "This ring underwent a fission that intertwined like vines. Whoever made it must be very skilled at what they do.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse2": "The aroma is sweet... These are the quality ones.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse3": "This must be the place where they do the 'quality test'.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse4": "The wines here are labeled from before 19XX!",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse5": "Old equipment, shoulder pads, and helmets are all stored in here.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse6": "Locked.#There does not seem to be anything for you here.",
    "RSVRI.EzekielHouse7": "This training sword is full of blue fur.#Someone recently trained with it using a little teddy bear.",

    "RSVRI.FreddieHouse": "Here are buttons, beads, pins, and needles.#Be careful not to prick yourself.",
    "RSVRI.FreddieHouse1": "There are several scraps of old clothes inside.",
    "RSVRI.FreddieHouse2": "The TV is completely broken.#But it seems someone is still very attached to it.",

    "RSVRI.IanHouse": "These are notes of completed jobs and projects.#The others are just scraps of paper that got stuck on the screen.",
    "RSVRI.IanHouse1": "The whole shop has a pleasant smell of wood and old things.#But this wood definitely stands out for its old smell.",
    "RSVRI.IanHouse2": "The boxes are full of knick-knacks.",
    "RSVRI.IanHouse3": "The calendar is full of tasks to complete.#Do they get any rest?",
    "RSVRI.IanHouse4": "This seems to be where Ian keeps his tools.#There is even an unused milking machine here...",
    "RSVRI.IanHouse5": "Everything is kind of messy and dusty.#...#Is this a sock?",

    "RSVRI.JericHouse": "At the best price.",
    "RSVRI.JericHouse1": "Limited stock.",
    "RSVRI.JericHouse2": "For a short time.",
    "RSVRI.JericHouse3": "There is a bit of everything here.#It seems to have accumulated over time.",
    "RSVRI.JericHouse4": "There is an egg inside.",

    "RSVRI.KennethHouse": "It's an old TV, colorless. It doesn't look good at all.#Someone must be very attached to want it repaired.",
    "RSVRI.KennethHouse2": "It's an old cabinet, but its parts are quite expensive and modern, and you recognize them.",

    "RSVRI.LennyHouse": "There are several organized files, separated by departments.#They must be associated with other places outside the valley.",
    "RSVRI.LennyHouse1": "You look at an entire shelf of achievements, news, and comments, all related to Ridgeside Village.#It seems Lenny is very proud of where she lives.",
    "RSVRI.LennyHouse2": "You pull a book and read the cover:#'Presidential Management: A College in a Book', Ferngill Publishing",
    "RSVRI.LennyHouse3": "You pull a different book:#It's a photo album, all old.#There are several villagers with terrible hairstyles and clothing styles.",
    "RSVRI.LennyHouse4": "You pick up an old and well-used book: 'Republic of Ferngill: A History'.",
    "RSVRI.LennyHouse5": "In the corner of the shelf, there is a pile of old comics, well preserved. They seem original.#That's a guaranteed retirement.",

    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel": "This machine is hotter than the others because of the sun.#Even on rainy days, use is not recommended.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel1": "The speaker box is signed with the name 'Ysabelle'.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel3": "These are some supplements for the guests.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel4": "It's a somewhat classic and modernist painting.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel5": "This bench serves as support for ballet dancers.#It's an alternative to the bars.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel6": "There is a note left here by some employee.#'Add all the barrels and disposal chests to the unused back areas of the hotel. At dawn, the barrels are removed and, the next morning, the space is free for new use. Thank you for your service, the community appreciates your support. Sincerely, Richard'#'P.S.: Don't forget to close the entrance when leaving'",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel7": "It's an agenda full of names of partner collection residences and disposal institutions.",
    "RSVRI.LogCabinHotel8": "*squeak* *squeak*#There is a sound coming from inside the box.#You open it.#There is a family of mice living here.#*SQUEAK* *SQUEAK* *SQUEAK*#They don't seem very happy with your presence.#You close it.",

    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse": "The trash is full of crumpled papers.#Strangely, several of them have a happy face drawn on them.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse1": "The plants seem to be very well cared for.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse2": "These are the monthly groceries.#There is a lot of wheat flour, oil, and tomato inside.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse3": "The fridge has plenty of vegetables and sweets.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse4": "Plates and cutlery piled up.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse5": "There are several lab books here.",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse6": "'Laboratory Devices - Applied Case Studies'",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse7": "A completely normal plant 'v'",
    "RSVRI.MaddieHouse8": "A delicious bruschetta!",

    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic": "- Tea corner -#'Enjoy the courtesy while you wait for your appointment.'",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic1": "It seems to be a ward for serious cases.",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic2": "The place hardly shows signs of use.#They must receive few patients here.",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic3": "Whoever placed all these plants must have wanted a comfortable environment for their patients.#And they nailed it!",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic4": "The light coming into the room is as warm as it is refreshing.",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic5": "Tea packets, vegetables, and... saline solution.",
    "RSVRI.PaulaClinic6": "The painting softly shimmers its colors when the light hits it.",

    "RSVRI.PikaHouse": "You smell the small dried plant.#It has a slightly bitter and sweet scent, very reminiscent of a clove used in sweets.#Hummm... The smell whets your appetite.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse1": "The stove, besides being large, is of great quality.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse2": "The cutlery in the drawer is fancy and has very different shapes.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse3": "This must be where Pika keeps the spices.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse4": "You pick up a book. It is clearly a cookbook, with a giant title that says 'Spices'.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse5": "You open the fridge and...#*WOW* *WOW* *WOW*#Starfruit, cabbage, beet, truffle, pickled cucumber, strawberry jam, coffee powder, several huge eggs, milk, cheese, mushrooms, kale, melon, pumpkin, wine, honey, mead, seeds, a... purple fruit, caviar, winter fish, tuna, eel, cherry, ginger, pineapple and a huge orange fruit that sweetens the entire room!!!#How does all this fit here???",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse6": "A completely unassuming toaster.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse7": "A strong smell comes from the box, but what could it be...#Ah! Cumin!",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse8": "This is Pika's storage.#Better not touch it.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse9": "'Contract Paper'#'I, Dad, sign this fully true contract, that I will cook ALL the meals on ALL rainy days, when I am not working, for my son, Keahi, if he cleans his room. -Sign here-'#The paper is completely written in colored pencil. Below, there is a signature made with black ink.",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse10": "The smell is great!#But unfortunately, there is nothing for you here...",
    "RSVRI.PikaHouse11": "The fish point is excellent!#But unfortunately, there is nothing for you here...",

    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion": "It's Sonny's private little garden.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion1": "The ceiling is made of glass, and the light that enters reflects throughout the room.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion2": "'Complete guide to plant care for beginners'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion3": "A fallen plant sprout grows here.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion4": "This plant doesn't seem to have intentionally grown in this pot.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion5": "Oh no.#As well cared for as it seems, it doesn't look like it will recover...",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion6": "It has an exceptional fragrance!",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion7": "The pot is being prepared for the addition of a new sprout.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion8": "It is far from home.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion9": "These barrels are not from here. The addresses indicate places outside the valley.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion10": "This plant seems to clean the air of the room.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion11": "The tea here seems to always be full. Judging by the environment, this must be the place for important meetings.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion12": "A sketch of a landscape with warm colors. Too bad it seems like a discarded idea.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion13": "There are clothes and socks here.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion14": "The shelf life of these products only expired a long time ago.#That must be the intention of the product.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion15": "They are preserved bottles, reserved for special events.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion16": "It's an entire wing full of junk. Savories, sweets, and everything that gives you cavities.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion17": "They seem to be part of a collection.#In the corner, there is a signature with two initials.#'R.C.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion18": "The brands clarify that they were handmade.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion19": "A camera left on the table.#It has a photo of the landscape seen from the balcony.#In the drawer next to it, you can see where the prints are kept.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion20": "At the bottom of the drawer, there is a broken jewel, hidden under a pile of cloths.#Someone didn't want it to be found.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion21": "'The beginning - The pain in the calluses and the air of novelty.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion22": "'The euphoria - Possession of the forest, conquering what is yours and what is not.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion23": "'Abundance - Full bellies; like a bear, seeking its first steps for hibernation.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion24": "'Experience - We are no longer speaking of someone unknown, the search for everything begins.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion25": "'Secrets - Man's greatest motivation is the search for the meaning of what has yet to be discovered.'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion26": "They are handmade jewels.#How much could this be worth?",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion27": "There are toys stored here.#Under books and notebooks.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion28": "'Dear Diary - I wish I knew what all this studying is for if I don't apply it in anything...'#Oops, better not read other people's private things.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion29": "'Dear Diary - Today I learned a new game! I will tell you...'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion30": "It's a painting canvas.#It seems it has never been used.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion31": "It's a painting canvas.#It has a beautiful drawing of a... well, it has a beautiful drawing here.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion32": "It's a mess down here.",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion33": "On one of the doll's little hands, there is a name written.#'Ariah'",
    "RSVRI.PurpleMansion34": "These boxes were placed here by Sonny.#He’s the one who manages the pantries.",

