    //MAIL
	"RSVRI.Mail.PikaInvitation": "Dear @,^^Thank you again for all the help you’ve given me. You really saved me a lot of work, and I’m very grateful for everything you’ve done. Lately, I’ve been cooking a lot on rainy days, testing new techniques and recipes. I think Keahi must be tired of eating my food so many times.^^Why not stop by someday when I’m cooking to try some of my dishes? Consider this an invitation – you’re always welcome.^^Mahalo, and thanks once again,^Pika[#]Pika’s Invitation",
    "RSVRI.Mail.SonnyProposal": "Dear @,^^I believe you recall our recent conversation regarding the pantry. Some matters have been properly arranged in your favor.^^When convenient, feel free to stop by.^^Sincerely,^Sonny[#]Sonny’s Gift",

    //EDITED EVENTS (Changes in the lines of text from the original)

    //Edited events 75160363 - Sonny 6 heart event (Purple Mansion)
    "RSVRI.75160363.01": "...this will go here.",
    "RSVRI.75160363.02": "...and this one, here.",
    "RSVRI.75160363.03": "Pardon me for not noticing you!#$b#Welcome, @. Do you need anything?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160363.04": "What was I doing?#$b#I was just storing the items that the Madame's children sent over for her.#$b#They occasionally send gifts to their mother.#$b#Though, it's plain to see that they are competing with each other for their mother's affection.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160363.05": "The Madame's children?#$b#They're all working abroad, each managing a major business under their family's main organization.#$b#But they rarely come home though, since they're all quite busy.#$b#It's such a shame... The children often miss their presence.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160363.06": "Oh, my! I got carried away with our talk!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160363.07": "Well... it seems they sent a considerable amount of supplies this time.$u",
    "RSVRI.75160363.08": "See, @...#$b#You have proven to be a very reliable presence in this mansion.#$b#Naturally, some accesses require the direct authorization of the Madame.#$b#Still, I believe that if you have a good friendship with her, I see no reason to deny you access to the pantry.$h#$b#It is usually well stocked, and many items end up going to waste over time.#$b#I believe the Madame would not object to such a decision.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160363.09": "I appreciated your company, @. We should talk more often!$h#$b#Excuse me, but I must get back to my tasks.",
    "RSVRI.75160363.10": "Have a good day, my friend! May Yoba bless you.$h",


    //VANILLA EVENTS (The lines of text here are the same as the original)

    //Event 75160451 - Bryle 4 heart event (Lenny House) //1.1.0
    "RSVRI.75160451.01": "Oh hey, @.#$b#I was just visiting Lenny so I can ask some questions about the recent events.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.02": "But it looks like she's still busy though.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.03": "Ah! How about I ask you about it for now?#$b#Is it fine if I ask you some questions? I just wanted to ask if you know anything about the suspicious red scarved individuals.#$b#Recently we had a tip that they saw someone suspicious parading around town wearing a red scarf.#$b#Any ideas?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.04": "Have you seen any suspicious people wearing red scarves?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.05": "Yeah I may know someone.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.06": "No I don't know anything.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.07": "Nothing, huh?$s#$b#Ah, it's fine. Thanks for the time anyway.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.08": "Oh! Hello there, detective!$h#$b#I'm sorry, I was just finishing up some paperwork.#$b#What can I do for you?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.09": "Nice to see you! Though, I hope I'm not interrupting.$h#$b#I'm just here to ask some questions, Lenny.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.10": "I'm sure you've heard about the recent reports on targeted and missing politicians.#$b#With my security firm, I'm working alongside the police to find clues on these suspected criminals.#$b#May I ask if you've seen any suspicious people wearing red scarves visiting the village lately?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.11": "Now that you mention it, I think we do have someone who fits that description.#$b#There's some guy who stays at this old cabin up north.#$b#Though he never seemed suspicious to us - a bit quiet, maybe, but really friendly with the kids.$h#$b#Doesn't really like anyone trespassing on his property though.#$b#Hmmm... Now that I think about it... That cabin doesn't really have any records too.$s#$b#Let me see...",
    "RSVRI.75160451.12": "Are they talking about Jio?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.13": "Let's see here...",
    "RSVRI.75160451.14": "Hmm? What's wrong, @?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.15": "Oh! Wait we do have some records about that cabin!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.16": "It looks like our mysterious neighbor has been here for quite a while.#$b#And the cabin has been here for about 50 years as well.#$b#And so far, no unusual acts have been reported from those who stayed there over these years.#$b#Oh! And Ezekiel's late wife, Helen, used to visit that place often too.#$b#Maybe you can ask Ezekiel if he knows anything?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.17": "Thank you for checking on it, Lenny.#$b#At least I have some clues on where to go next.$h#$b#Even though they may not be suspicious, I think it's better to be safe and visit that cabin anyway.#$b#I'll go visit the Daniels first as per your recommendation though. Thank you.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.18": "Just be careful not to pull on Ezekiel's wrong strings, okay?$s#$b#He's quite sensitive when it comes to the topic of his late wife.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.19": "I appreciate the tip, Lenny.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.20": "Well then, @. I guess I'll be seeing you around.#$b#I'll continue my investigation next time.$h#$b#I have to get back to Zuzu City to check on the Governor.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.01": "Oh! Someone, huh?#$b#Someone suspicious?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.02": "Not really? Can't decide? Hmm...#$b#Maybe I could ask Lenny more about it.#$b#Thanks for the tip, though! At least now I know there's someone here in this village who I can investigate on.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.03": "Oh! Hello there, detective!$h#$b#I'm sorry, I was just finishing up some paperwork.#$b#What can I do for you?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.04": "Nice to see you! Though, I hope I'm not interrupting.$h#$b#I'm just here to ask some questions, Lenny.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.05": "I'm sure you've heard about the recent reports on targeted and missing politicians.#$b#With my security firm, I'm working alongside the police to find clues on these suspected criminals.#$b#May I ask if you've seen any suspicious people wearing red scarves visiting the village lately?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.06": "Now that you mention it, I think we do have someone who fits that description.#$b#There's some guy who stays at this old cabin up north.#$b#Though he never seemed suspicious to us - a bit quiet, maybe, but really friendly with the kids.$h#$b#Doesn't really like anyone trespassing on his property though.#$b#Hmmm... Now that I think about it... That cabin doesn't really have any records too.$s#$b#Let me see...",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.07": "They seem to be talking about Jio.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.08": "Let's see here...",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.09": "I assume that's the same person you mentioned, @?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.10": "Oh! Wait we do have some records about that cabin!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.11": "It looks like our mysterious neighbor has been here for quite a while.#$b#And the cabin has been here for about 50 years as well.#$b#And so far, no unusual acts have been reported from those who stayed there over these years.#$b#Oh! And Ezekiel's late wife, Helen, used to visit that place often too.#$b#Maybe you can ask Ezekiel if he knows anything?",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.12": "Thank you for checking on it, Lenny.#$b#At least I have some clues on where to go next.$h#$b#Even though they may not be suspicious, I think it's better to be safe and visit that cabin anyway.#$b#I'll go visit the Daniels first as per your recommendation though. Thank you.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.13": "Just be careful not to pull on Ezekiel's wrong strings, okay?$s#$b#He's quite sensitive when it comes to the topic of his late wife.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.14": "I appreciate the tip, Lenny.",
    "RSVRI.75160451.Bryle4AnswerYes.15": "Well then, @. I guess I'll be seeing you around.#$b#I'll continue my investigation next time.$h#$b#I have to get back to Zuzu City to check on the Governor.$h",

    //Event 75160342 - Malaya worrying about a complete quest? (Aguar Lab)
    "RSVRI.75160342.01": "Are you sure they haven't contacted you lately, Mr. Aguar?$s#$b#My husband and I are worried about the message we sent them regarding the task we finished in their request because they haven't replied yet.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.02": "I'm certain of it you two.#$b#The merfolk are true to their word, and they said that if you fulfill their quest, then they'll leave you alone.#$b#As far as I'm concerned, you both have met the criteria from all your travels and messenger errands for your past kind.#$b#Hmph, so stop bothering me from my work because you both are being paranoid!$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.03": "We apologize, Mr. Aguar...$s#$b#But please confirm it for us if you can.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.04": "Hmph! Fine! Even after turning, you still seem to retain your people's anxious traits.$a#$b#I'll directly contact them from my chambers. You two stay here.",
    "RSVRI.75160342.05": "Oh dear... I hope it's true that we've fulfilled the quest.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.06": "Honey, calm down. I'm sure we are.#$b#What matters is we're back here with our daughter, right?",
    "RSVRI.75160342.07": "But...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.08": "Oh--Umm, hello, @.$u",
    "RSVRI.75160342.09": "Oh my! What a surprise to see you here, @.$u",
    "RSVRI.75160342.10": "Huh? what? What were we talking about?$u#$b#Oh, nothing, just, um... umm...$s#$b#Um... J-Just about paying back a debt to old friends, yes! That's all!$s#$b#Nothing out of the ordinary! Haha!$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.11": "Yes, um, Mr. Aguar is a mutual friend! And we're on bad terms with said other friends, so, um... well...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.12": "We just wanted to... um... make peace. Yes.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160342.13": "Yes! That's all!$h#$b#Like what my husband said!",
    "RSVRI.75160342.14": "You two, I was right.$a#$b#I told you both, they're satisfied with the completion of your quest, so you're both debt-free from the mer-$a",
    "RSVRI.75160342.15": "Oh!$u#$b#I mean debt-free from your old friends.#$b#Why are there so many people in my lab today?!$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.16": "See, @?$h#$b#Well uhmm... We better go back to work.$h#$b#We really appreciate the help, Mr. Aguar.#$b#We promise we won't bother you ever again...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.17": "Thank you.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160342.18": "Just please leave, all of you.#$b#You're all being a nuisance in my workplace!$a",
    "RSVRI.75160342.19": "That was all you heard in the laboratory earlier right? Oh, Yoba...$s",

    //Event 75160440 - Zayne 8 heart (Purple Mansion Ball)
    "RSVRI.75160440.01": "...and there's that.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.02": "@! I'm glad you could come.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.03": "Well, welcome!$h#$b#It's a small dinner party, with mostly just family and business partners present.#$b#Grandmother and I had our talk and she wants to officially announce her retirement first to family and friends.#$b#And then, I'll be taking over as the head of the Amethyne family.$7#$b#Which I admit I'm still a bit petrified at the thought of, but ready to do.#$b#I'll face the challenges head on.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.04": "Zayne, my grandson.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.05": "Well, here it goes.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.06": "Are you ready? Zayne?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.07": "I am, grandmother.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.08": "Maive taps her wine glass.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.09": "Ahem!#$b#Requesting everyone's attention.#$b#Madame Maive has an announcement.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.10": "Coming!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.11": "Oh! What's this?",
    "RSVRI.75160440.12": "Oh my!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.13": "Success, excellence, pride, grace, and power.#$b#Under the Amethyne name, those are to be expected.#$b#And due to that, pressure comes along with it.#$b#Some may say it's too much, others may say it's harsh.#$b#But without pressure, there are no diamonds.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.14": "The Amethyne family started in this village, and has remained in it for decades.#$b#Our ancestors strived for excellence and achieved success wherever they could extend their influence.#$b#For many years, I have managed countless businesses and projects under the Amethyne name, aiming to make this world a better place.#$b#My life's goal was to make sure the Amethyne name lives on with our core principles intact throughout the generations.#$b#And I may have done a decent job, but I admit, I feel that I have not done enough to broaden the glow of our purple light around the globe.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.15": "Which is something that none could say about this young man here with us today.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.16": "My grandson, Zayne Amethyne.#$b#Truly a shining example of the Amethyne potential.$h#$b#Soon, I'll be entrusting the entirety of the Amethyne family's businesses and board seats to this man.#$b#I know my limitations. Only a fool would let pride blind oneself from ruin.#$b#And when I am no longer capable of leading, I will leave the Amethyne name in the best and most trustworthy hands.#$b#Everyone... I hereby announce my retirement to you all. Firstly to my family and friends, then the public.#$b#Welcome the new Amethyne family head, Zayne Amethyne!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.17": "Well done!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.18": "Splendid!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.19": "Madame Maive, everyone.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.20": "Thank you, Grandmother.#$b#With this title and responsibility, I will make our family proud.$7#$b#And...$7#$b#Give it the necessary happiness and change it deserves.#$b#Our family's core principles have always been aimed to achieve greatness.#$b#And through those principles, I was able to achieve my dreams and so much more.#$b#I was able to help people and contribute to the greater good and well-being of the continent.$7#$b#But to speak truthfully, I believe that it wasn't all just thanks to those principles.#$b#But also with courage, passion, and love.$7#$b#The courage to dream big and never back down even when it scares you.$7#$b#The passion to do what's right and what's needed. Even if the world judges you for it.$7#$b#And love for the country, its people, and my family.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.21": "Family...$7#$b#A big reason why I'm here today is love of family.$7#$b#It's a big undertaking and responsibility, yes.$7#$b#I won't lie if I said I wasn't overwhelmed by the mere thought of the daunting task ahead of me.$s#$b#But people special to me have inspired me to be brave.$7#$b#And I owe everyone here the best I can give, for you all have made me who I am today.$h#$b#I will make you proud. I'll make sure of it!$h#$b#With that, I have a few announcements to make.#$b#First and foremost, the public has yet to learn of this announcement, so please let our family take care of the publicity.#$b#Secondly, I'll be retiring as an ambassador as well, to focus more on overseeing the family and its businesses.#$b#That means I will be staying around Ridgeside Village a lot more.$h#$b#And lastly, thank you everyone for coming.#$b#Enjoy the rest of the party, and once again, thank you. I promise I won't let you down.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.22": "Wonderful!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.23": "Party time!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.24": "Everyone seems to be enjoying the party.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.25": "Excuse me...",
    "RSVRI.75160440.26": "Zayne went out to take a breather.#You followed him out.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.27": "Oh! It's you.$h#$b#You saw me leaving the party, huh?$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.28": "Everything went well! Just a tad intense so I thought I needed a breather.$6#$b#Come, join me.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.29": "Wow. It's finally official.$7#$b#My running days are over... And thus, a new chapter for the Amethynes begins.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.30": "Thank you, @, for being my friend.$6",
    "RSVRI.75160440.31": "You see Zayne smiling as he looks into the distance, resting a hand atop the balcony fence.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.32": "Zayne is waiting for your response.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.33": "(Hold Zayne's hand)",
    "RSVRI.75160440.34": "You'll do great, Zayne.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.35": "I'll see to that, friend.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.36": "I hope everyone got home safe.$h",

    //Event 75160440 - Zayne 8 heart Alternate versions (Purple Mansion Ball)
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.01": "...And there's that.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.02": "@! I'm glad you could come.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.03": "Well, welcome!$h#$b#It's a small dinner party, with mostly just family and business partners present.#$b#Grandmother and I had our talk and she wants to officially announce her retirement first to family and friends.#$b#And then, I'll be taking over as the head of the Amethyne family.$7#$b#Which I admit I'm still a bit petrified at the thought of, but ready to do.#$b#I'll face the challenges head on.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.04": "Zayne, my grandson.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.05": "Well, here it goes.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.06": "Are you ready? Zayne?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.07": "I am, Grandmother.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.08": "Maive taps her wine glass.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.09": "Ahem!#$b#Requesting everyone's attention.#$b#Madame Maive has an announcement.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.10": "Coming!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.11": "Oh! What's this?",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.12": "Oh my!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.13": "Success, excellence, pride, grace, and power.#$b#Under the Amethyne name, those are to be expected.#$b#And due to that, pressure comes along with it.#$b#Some may say it's too much, others may say it's harsh.#$b#But without pressure, there are no diamonds.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.14": "The Amethyne family started in this village, and has remained in it for decades.#$b#Our ancestors strived for excellence and achieved success wherever they could extend their influence.#$b#For many years, I have managed countless businesses and projects under the Amethyne name, aiming to make this world a better place.#$b#My life's goal was to make sure the Amethyne name lives on with our core principles intact throughout the generations.#$b#And I may have done a decent job, but I admit, I feel that I have not done enough to broaden the glow of our purple light around the globe.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.15": "Which is something that none could say about this young man here with us today.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.16": "My grandson, Zayne Amethyne.#$b#Truly a shining example of the Amethyne potential.$h#$b#Soon, I'll be entrusting the entirety of the Amethyne family's businesses and board seats to this man.#$b#I know my limitations. Only a fool would let pride blind oneself from ruin.#$b#And when I am no longer capable of leading, I will leave the Amethyne name in the best and most trustworthy hands.#$b#Everyone... I hereby announce my retirement to you all. Firstly to my family and friends, then the public.#$b#Welcome the new Amethyne family head, Zayne Amethyne!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.17": "Well done!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.18": "Splendid!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.19": "Madame Maive, everyone.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.20": "Thank you, Grandmother.#$b#With this title and responsibility, I will make our family proud.$7#$b#And...$7#$b#Give it the necessary happiness and change it deserves.#$b#Our family's core principles have always been aimed to achieve greatness.#$b#And through those principles, I was able to achieve my dreams and so much more.#$b#I was able to help people and contribute to the greater good and well-being of the continent.$7#$b#But to speak truthfully, I believe that it wasn't all just thanks to those principles.#$b#But also with courage, passion, and love.$7#$b#The courage to dream big and never back down even when it scares you.$7#$b#The passion to do what's right and what's needed. Even if the world judges you for it.$7#$b#And love for the country, its people, and my family.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.21": "Family...$7#$b#A big reason why I'm here today is love of family.$7#$b#It's a big undertaking and responsibility, yes.$7#$b#I won't lie if I said I wasn't overwhelmed by the mere thought of the daunting task ahead of me.$s#$b#But people special to me have inspired me to be brave.$7#$b#And I owe everyone here the best I can give, for you all have made me who I am today.$h#$b#I will make you proud. I'll make sure of it!$h#$b#With that, I have a few announcements to make.#$b#First and foremost, the public has yet to learn of this announcement, so please let our family take care of the publicity.#$b#Secondly, I'll be retiring as an ambassador as well, to focus more on overseeing the family and its businesses.#$b#That means I will be staying around Ridgeside Village a lot more.$h#$b#And lastly, thank you everyone for coming.#$b#Enjoy the rest of the party, and once again, thank you. I promise I won't let you down.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.22": "Wonderful!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.23": "Party time!",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.24": "Everyone seems to be enjoying the party.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.25": "Excuse me...",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.26": "Zayne went out to take a breather.#Irene followed him out.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.27": "And where are you planning on escaping to, Mister Amethyne?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.28": "Well, well! If it isn't the traveling chef.$6",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.29": "In the flesh!$h#$b#Would you mind if I join you?",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.30": "Be my guest.$h#$b#The atmosphere in there was so intense, and I just needed a breather.#$b#But I'm glad it went well.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.31": "More than well! Zayne! You're the new head of the Amethyne family!#$b#That's... woah! I can't even comprehend how big that must feel!$h#$b#I wouldn't blame you if you needed a vacation after that announcement.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.32": "It's still sinking in. But, it is indeed quite the title.$6#$b#I'm also glad you could make it.#$b#I know you're busy with your travels and all.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.33": "I wouldn't miss this for the world!$h#$b#And I just wanted to say... well... I'm proud of you.$3#$b#I'm proud that you finally got the courage to accept the madame's position.$3",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.34": "I know you'll do amazing, Zayne.$l",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.35": "I'm just grateful that you still remember our conversation about my fear, Irene.$l#$b#And I'll see to it that your expectations are met... and beyond.$l",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.36": "*Squeee*$8#$b#Ehem! I mean... You better!$l#$b#Because I'll be the world's greatest chef and that would just mean even more pressure for you to handle.$l#$b#Because... I want to make you proud as well...$3",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.37": "You're amazing, Irene.$l",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.38": "Zayne offers his hand out.",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.39": "Hey, what is this?$l",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.40": "Would you care for a dance, Miss de Pillar?$l#$b#I know we can barely hear the music from the party, but I feel like this would help me relax from everything that just happened.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.41": "It would be my pleasure, Mister Amethyne.$l",
    "RSVRI.75160440.alt.42": "I hope everyone got home safe.$h",

    //Event 75160074 - Freddie 2 hearts Alternate versions (Freddie House)
    "RSVRI.75160074.01": "Hello there, young @.#$b#I'm on my way into town to do some shopping.#$b#If you're looking for my wife, she's in the shed.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.02": "Do I need any help?#$b#Oh, don't worry, these old bones can still manage a shopping trip on their own!$h#$b#See?",
    "RSVRI.75160074.03": "Oof! Maybe I'm not as spry as I thought...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160074.04": "Freddie seems to be having a little trouble moving.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.05": "If you really have to go into town, I can come along and help.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.Fork1": "Oh! Really?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.07": "You know, I might take you up on that.$h#$b#It's a bit embarrassing, having to renege on what I just said, but there's nothing to be done, I'm afraid.#$b#I won't be dancing a jig anytime soon, I'll tell you that!#$b#Anyway, errands. I'll take you up on that offer.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.08": "Well then, let's go.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.09": "Hmm... I think we need more pepper.#$b#Can you get some over there, @? I would really appreciate it.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.10": "The pepper's on the bottom shelf.#$b#Freddie, how's it going at the village?#$b#I haven't visited in ages!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.11": "Oh, same as always, Pierre.$h#$b#Peaceful to the point of being idyllic, I'm happy to say.#$b#I remember when you were young, playing around with Bert and Caroline in the village.#$b#Fond memories.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.12": "Oh, I remember those days!$h#$b#You never know what you had until it's gone, hmm?",
    "RSVRI.75160074.13": "Ah, this will do just fine, @.#$b#Thank you!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.14": "Here's what I owe you, Pierre.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.15": "Thanks, Freddie!$h#$b#@, take care of him on the way back, will you? Don't want him to fall and hurt himself.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.16": "Hey now! I took one wrong step. I'm not about to keel over!$a",
    "RSVRI.75160074.17": "Ahh... Every time I enter the village, it always reminds me of the first time my wife and I moved here.#$b#We just retired early from our old life and settled down.#$b#I still remember the faces of the young'uns from back then.#$b#Some moved and some stayed. As it goes.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.18": "Always try to enjoy your youth while you can, @.#$b#Most people take it for granted and worry too much about what's coming instead of what's already here.$s#$b#It never hurts to focus on the present from time to time, okay?$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.19": "Alright, then. Let's go back home.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.20": "Thank you again for the help, @.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160074.06": "Uh, I don't think you should go out.",
    "RSVRI.75160074.Fork2": "Hmmm... %fork$s",
    "RSVRI.75160074.FreddieStay.01": "I think you're right, @.$s#$b#Lola would be get angry if she found out I went out after taking a bad step.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160074.FreddieStay.02": "Oh, well. Take care now.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160074.FreddieStay.03": "Maybe tomorrow...$s",

    //Event 75160158 - Kenneth 4 hearts (KennethHouse)
    "RSVRI.75160158.01": "Oh, hi, @.#$b#What's this? Oh, it's a project I've been working on for some time now.$h#$b#I think I may take a big step forward today. I can feel it!$h#$b#Come look!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160158.02": "What exactly is it?#$b#Well... it's a friend.$h#$b#Umm, I don't think you'll understand that easily.$s#$b#But I'm sure it'll make sense when I get it up and running.$h#$b#Okay... I think it should work this time.#$b#I really hope so... I've been working on this for five years now.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160158.03": "Please work... please work...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160158.04": "Hmm...$6",
    "RSVRI.75160158.05": "Whoa! Hey, @! Are you okay!?$u#$b#I'm so sorry you almost got hurt!$s",
    "RSVRI.75160158.06": "I'm glad you're fine!$s#$b#Okay, I better put the fire out!$s",
    "RSVRI.75160158.07": "Huh? What's wrong, @?#$b#I'm already taking care of the fire, right?",
    "RSVRI.75160158.08": "What? My behind?$6",
    "RSVRI.75160158.09": "Oh...$u#$b#Well, this is bad.$u",
    "RSVRI.75160158.10": "Phew! Thanks, @!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160158.11": "It failed again, huh?$s#$b#Oh, well...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160158.12": "Hm...$s#$b#Oh, well...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160158.13": "Hey, @, thanks for taking care of the fire.$h#$b#I owe you lots now.$h#$b#I'm really sorry for the little scare as well.$s#$b#Next time, I'll make sure things go right!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160158.14": "Oh, well, I better start cleaning up the mess now.$h#$b#Make sure no other accidents can happen.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160158.15": "I'm glad things didn't get out of hand.#I do wonder what Kenneth was trying to create, though...",
    "RSVRI.75160158.16": "Good thing the fire didn't damage it too much!$h#$b#I saved a lot of my work! Thanks again for the help.",

    //Event 75160159 - Kenneth 6 hearts (KennethHouse)
    "RSVRI.75160159.01": "YES! YES!! IT'S WORKING!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160159.02": "Huh?#A dog?",
    "RSVRI.75160159.03": "There's a robotic dog!",
    "RSVRI.75160159.04": "It's working!!$h#$b#Finally!$h#$b#Hey there, bud!$h#$b#I missed you!$h",
    "RSVRI.75160159.05": "I missed you so much!$7#$b#Come! Come here!$h#$b#I... I've been waiting for this for so long!$7",
    "RSVRI.75160159.06": "Ohhhh, no, no!$s#$b#Please don't break now.$s",
    "RSVRI.75160159.07": "Buddy!$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.08": "Kenneth stands there in silence.",
    "RSVRI.75160159.09": "Heh... another failure, huh..$s#$b#I...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160159.10": "I was so close...$8#$b#I was so close, @... so close...$8#$b#I almost had him back.$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.11": "Oh, Buddy... Buddy... I can't seem to ever get you back, huh?$7#$b#I... I guess it's not meant to be...$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.12": "I'm sorry you had to see that.$s#$b#I... I'm fine.$s#$b#I... I'm just disappointed.$s#$b#I... gotta go to bed for now, I guess...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160159.13": "What's wrong?$s#$b#Huh... I guess I never really told anyone, huh?$s",
    "RSVRI.75160159.14": "To put it straight...$s#$b#I've been trying to 'revive' my late best friend...$s#$b#...my dog, Buddy.$s#$b#I... I just can't seem to get over it...$s#$b#I...$s",
    "RSVRI.75160159.15": "I miss him so much...$8#$b#I lost him six years ago.$8#$b#And he was all I had...$8#$b#And ever since then... I've been obsessed with recreating him with machines so I can have him back.$8#$b#I'm sure you've noticed the empty dog house outside.$8#$b#I still haven't gotten over it... I haven't accepted it.$8#$b#I haven't even visited his grave for such a long time now.$8#$b#I'm so behind... I'm still stuck...$8#$b#I have a problem...$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.16": "And, yeah... I tried and tried...$8#$b#But no success.$8#$b#I don't know what to do...$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.17": "Kenneth...",
    "RSVRI.75160159.18": "You need to move on... this isn't healthy anymore.",
    "RSVRI.75160159.19": "That's enough, wake up.",
    "RSVRI.75160159.20": "I've been wrong all this time, you see...$8#$b#I should accept it all... I don't think Buddy would like it if I kept torturing myself...$8#$b#I... I'll try.$8",
    "RSVRI.75160159.21": "You'll be there for me, huh?$8#$b#Heh... Thanks, @.$7#$b#You're a good friend.$7#$b#Ever since I started building Buddy, I haven't really been sociable.$8#$b#So... I'm glad you've become my friend.$7#$b#I think I'll be fine with friends like you around.$7#$b#I better start moving on, huh?$7",
    "RSVRI.75160159.22": "Yeah... I guess you're right.$7#$b#Buddy would want me to enjoy my life.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160159.23": "Well, now... I think I better clean up this mess.$7#$b#It's a big mess, not to mention a fire hazard.$h",
    "RSVRI.75160159.24": "Yeah... I better start putting all of this behind me now.$7",
    "RSVRI.75160159.25": "Kenneth has started his path to acceptance.#I hope he'll be alright.",
    "RSVRI.75160159.26": "Thank you for being there for me earlier, @.#$b#It means a lot!$h"
}